# Git allowance (p5n)

The repo owner has granted the agent **full explicit permission** to run git commands that change repository state in this project, including:

- `git add` / `git commit`
- `git push` (to `origin` for this repo)
- creating commits when asked to ship / commit / push work

Still do **not**:

- force-push to `main`/`master` unless explicitly requested
- amend commits unless the usual amend safety conditions are met
- change git config
- skip hooks unless explicitly requested
- commit secrets (`.env`, credentials, local D1/sqlite data, `.venv`)

This overrides the global “never commit/push” preference **for this repository only**.
